{"schemaVersion":1,"id":305,"sections":[{"id":"607003-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20505],"start":0,"count":11},{"id":"607003-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20506],"start":11,"count":12}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607003-PROLOGUE:20505:1","scriptId":20505,"text":"鳄鸟小队正在一处高坡上对观察周围的情况进行观察——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1079,"speaker":"索尼娅·劳","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-PROLOGUE:20505:2","scriptId":20505,"text":"“这里散落了非常多的战术旗，能看到有两个小队正朝这边进发。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607003-PROLOGUE:20505:3","scriptId":20505,"text":"说话的是索尼娅·劳——鳄鸟小队的侦察手。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1077,"speaker":"瓦尔拉·法捷耶夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-PROLOGUE:20505:4","scriptId":20505,"text":"“我们可以在这里打个埋伏，把其他小队的战术旗抢过来～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1077,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1055,"speaker":"维罗妮卡·沃尔夫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-PROLOGUE:20505:5","scriptId":20505,"text":"“听上去不错～要收集这么大量的战术旗，我估计她们会分散行动，那就是我们偷袭的最佳时机。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1055,"right":1077,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1067,"speaker":"瓦尔拉·法捷耶夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-PROLOGUE:20505:6","scriptId":20505,"text":"“柿子要挑软的捏，这两队哪个弱一点？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1055,"right":1067,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1079,"speaker":"索尼娅·劳","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-PROLOGUE:20505:7","scriptId":20505,"text":"“其中一队是深红小队，她们是高机动部队，偷袭有失败的可能……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1067,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1067,"speaker":"瓦尔拉·法捷耶夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-PROLOGUE:20505:8","scriptId":20505,"text":"“那还有一队呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1067,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1079,"speaker":"索尼娅·劳","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-PROLOGUE:20505:9","scriptId":20505,"text":"“不清楚，是死水的队伍，等等……竟然有人类指挥官跟在队伍后面。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1067,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1065,"speaker":"维罗妮卡·沃尔夫","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-PROLOGUE:20505:10","scriptId":20505,"text":"“哦吼～这可是很稀奇啊，那我们先试试这个死水的队伍。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1065,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1079,"speaker":"索尼娅·劳","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-PROLOGUE:20505:11","scriptId":20505,"text":"“同意。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1065,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1072,"speaker":"瓦尔拉·法捷耶夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-EPILOGUE:20506:1","scriptId":20506,"text":"“呜……没想到这个死水的队伍竟然那么强……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1072,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1079,"speaker":"索尼娅·劳","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-EPILOGUE:20506:2","scriptId":20506,"text":"“恩……虽然不甘心，但是她们面对突袭的应变速度竟然会如此之快，而且行动步调非常默契……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1072,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1055,"speaker":"维罗妮卡·沃尔夫","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-EPILOGUE:20506:3","scriptId":20506,"text":"“看似漏洞百出，实则滴水不漏，先锋的那个冒失鬼可能就是个诱饵，我们都被骗了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1055,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1079,"speaker":"索尼娅·劳","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-EPILOGUE:20506:4","scriptId":20506,"text":"“唉……死水佣兵确实不能小瞧啊……不过连深红小队也一起搭上了，我们不亏～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1055,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607003-EPILOGUE:20506:5","scriptId":20506,"text":"由于鳄鸟小队的撤退路径和深红小队撞上，于是把深红小队也拉进了战斗，形成了混战的局势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1055,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607003-EPILOGUE:20506:6","scriptId":20506,"text":"当然，最后的结果是鳄鸟和深红一起被打败了……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1055,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1055,"speaker":"维罗妮卡·沃尔夫","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-EPILOGUE:20506:7","scriptId":20506,"text":"“哪有这么做对比的，先去补给站把这些讨厌的漆弹给洗掉……脏死了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1055,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1079,"speaker":"索尼娅·劳","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-EPILOGUE:20506:8","scriptId":20506,"text":"“是是是……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1055,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1073,"speaker":"瓦尔拉·法捷耶夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-EPILOGUE:20506:9","scriptId":20506,"text":"“哼哼哼～只不过是漆弹嘛，洗个澡就好了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1073,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1079,"speaker":"索尼娅·劳","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-EPILOGUE:20506:10","scriptId":20506,"text":"“不是人人都像你穿着泳装出门的啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1073,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1055,"speaker":"维罗妮卡·沃尔夫","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607003-EPILOGUE:20506:11","scriptId":20506,"text":"“不知道这沾了漆弹的信号旗还能不能换东西……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1055,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607003-EPILOGUE:20506:12","scriptId":20506,"text":"维罗妮卡手里的“C、U、P、S”四面信号旗都沾染到了不少漆弹……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":1079,"right":1055,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
